   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,153:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 4  | 9.65e-4 | 2.62e-2 | 2.45e-1 |
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,153:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
