   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,154:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,154:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 16 |
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,155:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 3.22e-4 | 7.09e-3 | 2.12e-1 |
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,155:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,155:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 20 | 4.00e-4 | 1.11e-2 | 2.10e-1 |
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,155:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: All tests use the LS estimator with QPSK on the TR 38.901 UMi channel.
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,156:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | Factory | Dimensions | Machines | UTs | Avg. Latency |
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,156:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,156:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: |---|---|---|---|---|
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,156:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,156:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | Small | 15x15x5 m | 5 | 4 | 484 ms |
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,157:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,157:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: |
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,157:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Medium | 25x25x6 m | 10 | 8 | 809 ms |
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,158:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,158:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | Large | 40x40x8 m | 20 | 16 | 1,727 ms |
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,158:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Analysis:
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,158:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,159:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Small factory
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,159:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  performs as expected with a BER floor of ~3 x 10^-4.
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,159:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,160:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Medium factory
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,163:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  is 20-30x worse (BER floor ~6-11 x 10^-3). More machines create additional
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,163:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: multipath, more UTs increase interference, and the 8-antenna BS has less spatial degrees of freedom
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,164:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: per user.
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,164:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,164:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Large factory
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,168:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  is catastrophic: BER is stuck at ~0.21 across all SNR levels. The LS estimator cannot
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,169:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: cope with 16 UTs on 8 BS antennas (under-determined system), severe multipath from 20 machines,
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,170:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: and the larger propagation distances. 
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,170:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: This configuration is fundamentally broken and needs
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,171:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: architectural changes
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,171:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (more BS antennas, distributed MIMO, or user scheduling to reduce
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,171:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: simultaneous UTs).
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,172:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,172:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Latency scales with factory size due to more UTs and larger resource grids.
   DEBUG: 2026-03-27 09:30:21,172:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 7. JIDD-SCMA Analysis
